      "parameter": "applicant",
      "behavior": "member: Only the member can apply. The Eligibility Page question “Would you like to add dependent coverage?” is hidden. Content that communicates dependent availability is also hidden, including the “Available for: You, Your Spouse, Your Child(ren)” sentence in the About Coverage component.\nmember,spouse: Only the member and/or spouse can apply. On the Eligibility Page, the “Child” option is hidden from the “Would you like to add dependent coverage?” question. Content that communicates child availability is also hidden, including the “Available for: You, Your Spouse, Your Child(ren)” sentence in the About Coverage component.",
      "status": "Modified"
    },
    {
      "id": "category",
      "key": "category",
